01:01:57.935 --> 01:02:03.695
citizens in any given neighborhood with uh the police department uh identifying

01:02:03.695 --> 01:02:08.294
uh the issues there and also uh one of the unsung.

01:02:09.679 --> 01:02:12.860
Benefits of being in a community watch program.

01:02:13.570 --> 01:02:21.120
If you are able to identify or, or to identify to uh HPD the good characters

01:02:21.120 --> 01:02:26.149
versus the bad characters in in the neighborhood so that the good characters

01:02:26.149 --> 01:02:30.159
are not um rounded up with the usual list of suspects.

01:02:30.239 --> 01:02:35.659
So, um, there are tremendous benefits to being in a community watch uh program

01:02:35.659 --> 01:02:37.189
in individual neighborhoods.

01:02:37.479 --> 01:02:40.120
If you are not part of a neighborhood that has a.

01:02:40.209 --> 01:02:43.830
Program, please, please reach out to myself or some,

01:02:43.929 --> 01:02:48.610
uh, HPD officer, and we'll be happy to give you information of how your

01:02:48.610 --> 01:02:52.330
neighborhood can become a part of that network and that's it for me,

01:02:52.449 --> 01:02:53.219
Madam President.

